Usage: ip fou add port PORT { ipproto PROTO  | gue }
		   [ local IFADDR ] [ peer IFADDR ]
		   [ peer_port PORT ] [ dev IFNAME ]
       ip fou del port PORT [ local IFADDR ]
		   [ peer IFADDR ] [ peer_port PORT ]
		   [ dev IFNAME ]
       ip fou show

Where: PROTO { ipproto-name | 1..255 }
       PORT { 1..65535 }
       IFADDR { addr }
